      "fact": "plus_num",
      "say": "With the plus sign: ([[negb]] + [[sqrtdisc]]) \u00f7 [[twicea]] = [[plus_num]] \u00f7 [[twicea]] = [[plus_root]]."
    },
    {
      "fact": "minus_num",
      "say": "With the minus sign: ([[negb]] \u2212 [[sqrtdisc]]) \u00f7 [[twicea]] = [[minus_num]] \u00f7 [[twicea]] = [[minus_root]]."
